swimlane-beta TB
  subgraph Requester
    ask([Submit request])
    done((Done))
  end
  subgraph Reviewer
    check{Complete?}
    retry[Ask for details]
    retry --> retry
  end
  subgraph Platform
    build[[Provision]]
    notify>Notify]
  end
  ask --> check
  check -->|no| retry
  retry -.-> ask
  check ==>|yes| build
  build --> notify
  notify --> done
  ask --> notify
